{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1542,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36289b55da2d71117e9e171f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄！\\n如英雄一般勇敢奔跑取得了胜利\\n如同扮演了精彩故事的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af47ff18555c135c7b7a03f28888b98ab62a6136b1fd00d3c84f261019e57085",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca2472109d65f19ae184524",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦！\n以绝不动摇的好胜之心\n为我们展现了无可撼动的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e98649425a168a8046c3abfeede3655e84b4dad92ae1d50419d88516d8458b20",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ca2cdb4fcb8d863907291d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "中山庆典！\\n展现出将一切赌在那一瞬机遇之中的灵魂奔跑\\n精彩地赢下了对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae113addcbd5844e1c765653650545e3952994fef93678ee55cac98e3d04323d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4177d45f2f15f538776ed3cf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "成田大进！\n充分展示了她那世代第一的速度\n在这大舞台上正面了自己的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac35c0c96c23444014b0638ce942d44338b4e57f22faaafc7372823fb217589a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bea864829f95906a9dc7f33",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "西野花！\\n她以可爱且给人以勇气的奔跑\\n令巨大的花朵绽放了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f24a89f25ac1e01fc3e07132ff71a40f95b8479c6d48aae43aa44de9821567",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dddb54f2667df3ae7fdba6ed",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "春丽！\n她以永不言弃的不屈精神斩获冠军的身影\n真可谓春光烂漫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc5b8c6b65fc245a6fdf6e361432cc9d50c30fb7339e399aa6bd0ce8c4ee17b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac726379f1ac75f5ca08e05",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "青竹回忆！\\n她着凭自己勇往直前向梦想全力冲刺的精神，\n在这场强敌云集的比赛中胜出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba885a49f500e810091251e14cb29181bbb7c614bdd7af66eb050f94a409966",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e369578b20778eea1c33ae9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "美丽周日！\\n她为我们带来了惊喜与感动\\n那出色的跑法正可谓是Marvelous！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7445401c3d1e8d55b533997e839d8ed8146f87fe5511916d4fa2d343cba37fce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1b8424bd563e90e2ddb446",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "待兼福来！\n她用坚信自己实力的奔跑\n成功将“福”招“来”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb94ca93730bd52edb9cfd60f962983655e53e90ddd3ccf8c40b81ced712709",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c5c1aef52f2ca759d8f94e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "千明代表！\\n她凭借着无拘无束的天真烂漫的跑法\\n展现出了压倒性的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "343103ec28a5e6b5d537f61e8fb79bf68fbae8f5e63ea777093ff0f6e3a59c62",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:005fc524241dc5f8c1a7556a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛！\n胸怀萌生的自信\n斩获了超越霸王的最佳成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "123a1477585dc4757dc3430ae2d4fd11060edf251e76b2a20bb0c84d53b25340",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:411a7679668154b405161fe8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白多伯！\n怀着名门马娘的坚强意志\n为我们展现了精彩的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "62b14281cc43d0b33dd3ef8e417cf8c930701d53b1ee2f5164e0d2e8313bc2ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041c7af6c1789a878f79c734",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "优秀素质！\n她那优秀的素质成功绽放\n斩获冠军，堂堂正正地回应了大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad4c6abd9b9f97d0b7d64a1953e9a604dabccc05f6ae34ce309e8b8fe3ce51d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6645030f185d3680f169b0ee",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "圣王光环！\n战胜众多强敌\n取得了不负圣王之名的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd40c00d5864d75130b19a5ddcc7d1359e7970719790ae467b626ce665423d7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb900c0d7447986a4f9aa1c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧！\n发挥出她那与生俱来的专注力\n展现了足以回应粉丝呼声的出色奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4470dee10be333f91b804b8840547f2ae6b48ea4c19421600a5eb4c1021d0e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250bd30bead79f97dafeba72",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯！\\n以一颗卓越的克己之心参赛\\n为我们献上了诸多胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceecd8ec88d9737320b5673ff5f9993176f24f5605dbd23470ab727b848f2305",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb2464c0fa1d90697a23aefe",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白善信！\\n没有被豪门之名束缚，她那自由的领放姿态\\n铭刻到了我们的记忆之中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ccb08aba1d25035a7b37d2be7de9078e02d7749e0fc4085899f7bc6db7e57bd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc6e5974dca7429f34d7fb90",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神！\\n她用那如烈日般无止境的光芒\\n在我们的心灵与胜利之间搭起了一座坚实的光之桥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "267c43a9ff79d403cea74940250381273e5093691ba9b595c22928acd2f73dde",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08fa355ae1f800d8bec31859",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "双涡轮！\\n她用尽浑身解数以爆领守住了领头位\\n成就了一番非凡功绩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0becfb0eab426f1d5b0e9f4b158824184333e8906bb680832e35fb3240cafb7b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1032a96eb55be92f17a474a4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "里见光钻！\n实现了被托付于身的期待与愿望\n用胜利为我们展现了自己前行的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1c00b7e1f5417ad7a59cebbcaff5bb79f603497cb442c7fd301c542c0f9c953",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee92e981bb97abb2a8fb668d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹！\n肩负着梦想与希望\n用胜利给予了我们喜悦和勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74d76678c936b6c4f15db30e8c6e4b6a540871067aa56853e229108610908a3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14697efb555141775aaf69a0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王！\n一心一意努力开花结果\n成功令荣光之樱绽放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34f3d2eca932b465440d8363239c50e8cf16733a9b06e425e1ab14e792f49c1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cf29a86fbee17d70fe12b10",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征！\\n她用能够支撑起自己野心的最强跑法\\n证明了自己作为一等星的辉煌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2586a65a9b525585e9ab845c81a4e2c8148d43af0697fe4751a0cd271b0bc38a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d895176c1f44367613d01bf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹！\n她那脆弱，坚强而美丽的奔跑\n在这大舞台上放出了耀眼的光辉",
      "source_fingerprint": "327d4c5858d671182552295979d2c1ccc8a546727f72af3f57caf0be9e5d1267",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2a20852b78d29f81dad689",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "八重无敌！\\n凭借自我磨炼出的武之精神与凛然的奔跑，\\n成功击败了一众豪强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca137bcb1a8eec0a2d9f7bec05cea5875be8f2d36b5fdd6680a1729dfd96035",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffd8c7a440572cb904ec4c22",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白光明！\n继承名门之威光，即便面对最强的对手\n也以绝不服输的奔跑斩获了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62a1a77ca612026494edcf7fc71ab91d34a5bb906021b3daceb63af3a78827ca",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:466fdceed7187c4ec0f2f7fb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "这将会是决出今年沙土中距离王者的一战！\\n希望她能够发挥出世界级的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57940e9a5d662a0a35927e0a8f3329f3b9d02df21c8df91730aaa983771eb1e0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8e440e3b045f98769822dd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她在这场船桥初夏的沙土英里赛事上，\\n能够成长为顶尖级的选手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2576f14f0b3a605324ff59f1748cac554e6ccf831b167f2d58a8cce793357c93",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041447f70a9400f3ba6f3ff3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她能驰骋在陆奥的长直道之上，\\n展现出不辱“沙土赛事代言人”之名的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42046d862332810ad1644cd26e686e41661104e38ba000cd165e05bc1ca83d0e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:187e0f17cb274b4572df82ec",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "这位选手的力量与速度天赋异禀，\\n也许明年能够成为担起整个沙土界的新星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71f9884a10432925eba5281d77e33df2479fa179d5f408bdcbcf2102cf70c552",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00e61f05dd9ef888bf3700d4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石！\\n怀揣身为华丽一族的骄傲\\n展现出绽放最耀眼光芒的精彩奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0ef1d6df5d457ece45d5bd74960eb32a7c45caa021928ef900602c95f831dc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e8391e556fc80843b9d6f7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "吉兆！\\n以不负漆黑的帝王之名的精彩跑法\\n完成了赢得最重要胜利这项使命！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eda0bcbb29b00897dac15b8a1fe78b1e527f2e71c5e205be59d6ad019306d5a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc302f6b0acd47320c7706de",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠！\\n她凭借不屈不挠的心和秘藏于内的热情\\n让大朵樱花在这最大舞台上绽放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "133765fab4401bf6ab89cf76c5f0dc45e2571cb316269eda5a656875f9934448",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f26f2b4127acd9e1f59454",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "新宇宙！\\n她展现出甩开所有选手的超常跑法\\n在这大舞台上取得了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd8308d05ce6d388b26f994f7ab5cd43def23a98717807cfe16a4246c2ed52a8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dee97ddbdb8c5770119ec22",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "菱钻奇宝！\\n她展现出用绝不平凡的脚力来回应\\n热情的粉丝的奇迹般的跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95cbe10ed5fbeea3ed0d2718a4884ae752a3183463fdd61c0acef9f96a79865f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed47449bc0a5e676d11386b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒！\\n她兼备了速度与力量的最强跑法\\n令我们沉醉其中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cafd9b029e207949be1727fb85ff149b454b96c8bf447a5af9f795517821a557",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac87a42ec9072c976e69619",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌！\\n她凭借那颠覆常识的气势昂扬的跑法\\n证明了自己正是一张王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f465f8664a1758a815b015685b90bee6c3fb7808f6212d84f725ca51fb9b3b1d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:013f8dd8b987fc47d5cf09b8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "成田路！\\n经历漫长道路最终让自己成为了主角\\n以巨大胜利回应了粉丝的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a0956d6ff74af7fc0c9e45717b4dce24d4a43ff0030652a198a7160e0a2db2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:258a2c095d2754790bc81ae8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉！\\n以接近所憧憬的风的触及灵魂的跑法\\n在这个大舞台上掀起了波澜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5be8a74a0e426ed9bc6283dc3c43d7e0b16759e4a62ff2ace6a688c219be9c3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f186effe5789aabb52f074",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "真弓快车！\\n以可爱但又犀利的令人印象深刻的跑法\\n让我们见证一场足以弥留于心的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3587b59ea2e8349e55f770be5083cab3a446aef250b732435abe15f921ed6089",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d65d1fb7c6fa232f647ada9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "小林历奇！\\n以饱含自己信念以及理运的跑法\\n为我们带来了「Happy」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b7e69b3473dd33f8fb5943654bab0496c7ed7ab2d8f2346643f3c47ae7e6b6f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfde3371bb257288d75ca25e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "北港火山！\\n心怀对故乡・苫小牧的强烈心意\\n让我们见证一场立于前所未有之巅峰的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "344bc85c6f2e4337f342aeaf9238aeb31e3dc6f5fd891c8adeca8dfb941ac8e8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3a889847548458ca2468288",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏！\\n用坚忍不拔的跑法向粉丝们传递了希望\\n展现了属于熏银的潜力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6224242da527d1a9858badb5dc698099ed22a63730486468a0357ce7c62a741",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:116408afab18ef0659043116",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "微光飞驹，\\n用她配得上英雄之名的跑法\\n给我们带来了梦想和希望！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37199bb1b0d55de0cd034ea100b5f97846f2ea16f7d4163e9fbc59b5a97ca96e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6fa0e92cb6e8b790a8618db",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放！！\\n完美展现了自己的血脉之结晶\\n成为了最强者的化身！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b723c6c49605933273b1897f2862b7361cad11643a44dc2f711bfe891e8a9ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68dd116313f9d7c2010faf01",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "创升！\\n她寻求开拓新领域不断奔跑着\\n成功超越了阻挡她的强敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b888740da72eb999ae737f5707a0856e024f323eb23168d0ec78b34c372d2549",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d871a0df2feb373ff299b24",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量！\\n向着自己的目标不断前进并获得胜利\\n将自己的跑法与心意传递给了后来者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be551b16a2ab8fd4abe2305c884ad9e956c86435d8050e406015f7ac05c7d110",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc30c5b9f9ed181c9225e2d5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "万籁争鸣！\\n她与对手们精彩合奏\\n向我们展示身为比赛的主角的跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d210a54303aa723b8f35e38d776ceefafd4ab03ee1168065e71d58555baa0d4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63100ece6e82f1f1ad99815f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "北方飞翔！\\n凭借自己不懈努力所磨练出的美学\\n向我们展现出了最耀眼的光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b403f7c245b765649676a52c076e984a124b62a8b1c93f3ee54f4ed05784c90",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4bdf526d8e26427e8081ce8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "森林宝穴！\\n通过与强敌的对战所磨炼出的双脚\\n向我们证明了她就是最强者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "755d7befccaec15de524b305776ba2170bfc93493d1b1a96ead8e7edb78185a3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:120e7d917419a66e484d903c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "梦之旅！\\n以其天生聪慧和有素身体\\n获得了使自己旅途生辉的桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "872db9908b52880ab05e000bda4f5e4a969ce2e794bde1285eb68ba223801c9d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f9a58461c1255032d8919e8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "贵妇人！\\n她在最重要一场比赛上展现出无人能敌的力量与高贵气质\\n证明了自己作为最强女帝的压倒性实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c0c584c6b2b3d87a75304d92adaf9f10b0520a863ea6f7b5ffdcef25359611",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8c8ffea3b23b00318fe53d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志！\\n无论跌倒多少次都始终向着憧憬伸出手，\\n绽放出了不逊于对手的最强光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d07998009a364986a33d70b66f97b76803ea92d1facdce9c8b4f787b9ec03ec",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f41a66ae4f78d84931760e7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白高峰！\\n以那份憧憬与嫉妒都无法企及的魅惑跑法，\\n为我们展现了一场完美的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e16ec6f2b6763620eef2c169da678050d1f55e17c54678ada12367c6f8ff60",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2a94dac563d118e8d30fd97",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠！\\n如同变魔术般决定了华丽的战术，\\n在这场大赛中将桂冠收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17a992517f99fa8ac01bd77754fc9f374ac8b6ab3668af934ff2ed142549e873",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e98b7f5cb5d9459f7ffb20f8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸！\\n精彩地发挥了不逊于姐妹的才能，\\n展现出了无愧于「伟大赛马娘」之名的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0001aac75884c62473f1f954108964aad3507177e6de0a36e065cf7337bb24",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f676c6bebf35d5d00b63bf7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "强击！\\n那如同夜空中闪耀群星般的奔跑，\\n让凯歌响彻了遥远的中东大地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a5f2265a37f6eb4d7a1fece5fc65c95780e3cc34fc907dbed9039bf9285025",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69140995704f60c1bd5dce6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹！\\n展现出了足以报答大恩的灵魂之跑，\\n用自己的双脚亲手创造了『奇迹』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c67c445a20e94823c37b5d45fe0acb43787dca993a0bbfdbd7addcb4f4f2e441",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce66750a4cb067231c46e95d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "跳舞城！\\n凭借高举的梦想与浪漫席卷赛马界，\\n将那独一无二的宝藏收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9ecd7b9fc4f6ce26de27428a4e46606bbd9c207e9653aa07382eea391970bf5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4161b880dc58c90ce9648966",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥！\\n为了成为通往未来的基石而夺得荣冠，那身姿\\n正是日本的超级巨星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8f62027dc84c57b05aab2b7d51f5a024181d7a59094b6e84d57f9ca01904822",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dec24395789ce59d89177ca",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "空中救世主！\\n胸怀对母亲的爱意，让诚实的努力结出果实，\\n夺取了连接未来的辉煌荣耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5291d4f30d4fbf3d338d1f783294094a5c9f7318319f1d065c105e976b075ba1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eeccee964307d577dc4aad1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "黄金巨匠！\\n以压倒性的奔跑将所有荣耀尽收囊中，\\n向我们展示了那草地之王的身姿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d9825f6e2d404a689a0da223152e8a099cd56e02d58e596cfaa68a690d9a205",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a22dbcffc3436a48848c1fb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "凯旋芭蕾！\\n面对强敌毫不退缩地数次站起，\\n精彩地夺得了领衔主演的宝座！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e26f8d92c5d3a3c6602dda9eb37302219891dcaa2cae387ab02897d5554d303",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049efd8b3c50d5ede120a771",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "金镇之光！\\n抵达了连光芒都能甩在脑后的速度境界，\\n以最快之姿纵横赛马界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54760c43cd7f008ba4ae4a46c730f46fcc6035692ccfcb67039ad993172c9c0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be02953f596062faed2e0442",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "多旺达！\\n将身为忠诚骑士的骄傲寄托于那柄“圣剑”，\\n凭那举世无双的末脚斩落强敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9cd66636e0197839662d0f3d5b63bef8104606b62a15f2421a7cf7a0a78021c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6c218543a25e9a05775331",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "吹波糖！\\n率先起跑冲在最前，用那双腿\\n达成了从未有人见过的伟业！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cd90268734a6b87ce5d02b20650ccfa61c11e3d715bc0f5ed059d87bd676dd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ade29e00395ebfa5e1596b7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "极峰！\\n磨砺出不惧困难的不屈精神与高洁意志，\\n成为了屡战屡胜的最强女王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "946b8883edef8b3f1b5c00c0b8e9775db9d43e91f6d9984da766b1626c7484c1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee577c47b4a1f15e94b6cda",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你！\\n将满身承载的爱化作力量，用那跑姿\\n赢得了令全世界为之沉醉的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa7c0213958e54bb1ed15989f12125b0a0366f9c7f5f9dd362815f5264b2738f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a308262bf22a11482ac47f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "创世驹！\\n凭借回应粉丝梦想的最强奔跑，\\n成为了被未来永世传颂的时代主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "247bcd994f496d9415ad8cbb9135e574ad4a3f98e41d9f5206692ac079a47908",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725320ce26c1790a09cb9efd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔！\\n证明了世上绝无仅有的皇冠之辉，\\n以魅惑的跑法，将荣光收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3738febd51e29ed4c2f4617a6e3840f6a785c995b68e6126e73e82c5b8f1702d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee4bd5b7d68910ce9053e7b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "放声欢呼！\\n让天真烂漫的才能尽情爆发，\\n以前所未有的次元末脚实现了超越！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10b00db267103ca67979e7f374be30fd5282b3ab226c772c03652275a7803c72",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084ac13e00659ac8314db830",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "超常骏骥！\\n贯彻始终如一的踏实与诚实跑法，\\n凭堂堂正正的胜利登上了顶峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12a4f666382f05d442078e02b1c89327598289b9a4b55dd0259fe87d20192d02",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b27b138885e3a47d05fa6410",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "莫名其妙！\\n精彩地讨伐了名声显赫的俊杰们，\\n达成了赛马界的天下统一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47400ece990a3e7edf0bd59dc343c8a281bd353c5e449af2216ef93733024027",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81bd60b66d90017728d1825b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "烈焰快驹！\\n即便面对最强对手也坚持不懈地努力，\\n终于夺得了站在舞台中心的荣耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c9f77cd15f8d37bb688b03bb7ef9bfb9388625a83e9efa4ea4c936427ca4f1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdae97270817aa8c23a535c7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "迷人景致！\\n凭借那份备受喜爱的赤诚积累努力，\\n终于抵达了梦寐以求的“绝景”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f0959568918abeddfdf0e61e7d16304c38024afe5199cde784dcc11a3a9e4fd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1e2a965330790d7be92954",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "黄金旅程！\\n在备受粉丝关爱抵达的旅途终点，\\n夺得了夙愿已偿、且永恒不灭的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9a2f8b4285bf33264d27dcb7872c56964b6d13f0481981eeb1b1420959992d9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:392521b83028d8d53a17e304",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "神业！\\n留下了不逊于最强女主角们的结果与记忆，\\n以此证明了自己才是比赛的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebba89b131c1e49c23d59f7b6318661e629ea8d3bd26422b95fb412570365cc9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29ce38e97a8f17fcb740c0b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "莱斯莱斯！\\n在不懈钻研后抵达了戏剧性的结局，\\n让自己成为了赛马这场大戏的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "087aebfb7ab755e1452bb673c8dc0f64a0d6c946d5fbc3ed5bb64970dea4c428",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e65d002c6449d157ef6a55e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "杏目！\\n不断积累无人可及的长久荣光，\\n成为了名留青史的赛马界超级巨星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1eb36e21991ea8f03614401e07bd509e86a73184aa8c4faef3c181091b34c83",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3147"
      ]
    },
    {
